hecked by reference to the bill vide paragraph 224 of the Audit Manual.</p>\n<p align=\"JUSTIFY\">2. Certified that the rates of pay as shown in column 3 have been verified with the amounts actually drawn in the bill.</p>\n<p align=\"RIGHT\">Dated initial of the Auditor—————</p>\n<p align=\"RIGHT\">Department Audit Section—————</p></font>"}